            {
              "text": "She stared down at the wet ground with deep regret.",
              "audioStart": 114.575,
              "audioEnd": 117.15
            },
            {
              "text": "She learned a hard lesson that day.",
              "audioStart": 118.013,
              "audioEnd": 119.8
            },
            {
              "text": "She realized that nobody should ever count on things before they actually happen.",
              "audioStart": 120.662,
              "audioEnd": 124.688
            },
            {
              "text": "She walked home slowly.",
              "audioStart": 125.55,
              "audioEnd": 126.925
            },
            {
              "text": "She was thinking about her mistakes.",
              "audioStart": 127.787,
              "audioEnd": 129.662
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun was shining brightly in the sky.",
              "audioStart": 130.525,
              "audioEnd": 132.613
            },
            {
              "text": "However, she felt very cold inside.",
              "audioStart": 133.475,
              "audioEnd": 135.7
            },
            {
              "text": "Her mother would surely ask about the empty metal container.",
              "audioStart": 136.562,
              "audioEnd": 139.575
            },
            {
              "text": "What would she tell her family?",
              "audioStart": 140.438,
              "audioEnd": 141.863
            },
            {
              "text": "She had lost everything in a single moment.",
              "audioStart": 142.725,
              "audioEnd": 144.95
            },
            {
              "text": "That loss happened because of her silly imagination.",
              "audioStart": 145.812,
              "audioEnd": 148.537
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Life is full of strange turns.",
              "audioStart": 149.4,
              "audioEnd": 151.137
            },
            {
              "text": "People must remain careful.",
              "audioStart": 152,
              "audioEnd": 153.5
            },
            {
              "text": "If she had kept her mind on the road, the liquid would have reached the market.",
              "audioStart": 154.363,
              "audioEnd": 158.137
            },
            {
              "text": "It would have arrived safely.",
              "audioStart": 159,
              "audioEnd": 160.425
            },
            {
              "text": "Instead, she lost both the liquid and her future plans at the exact same time.",
              "audioStart": 161.287,
              "audioEnd": 165.875
            },
            {
              "text": "Many other young people make similar mistakes every single day.",
              "audioStart": 166.738,
              "audioEnd": 170.062
            },
            {
              "text": "They build huge dreams upon foundations that do not yet exist.",
              "audioStart": 170.925,
              "audioEnd": 174.463
            },
            {
              "text": "Experience is often the best teacher that anyone can ever find.",
              "audioStart": 175.325,
              "audioEnd": 178.825
            },
            {
              "text": "She promised herself that she would never act so silly again.",
              "audioStart": 179.688,
              "audioEnd": 182.887
            },
            {
              "text": "From that morning forward, she decided to focus only on reality.",
              "audioStart": 183.75,
              "audioEnd": 187.35
            },
            {
              "text": "She would avoid empty dreams.",
              "audioStart": 188.213,
              "audioEnd": 189.838
            },
            {
              "text": "The road ahead was long.",
              "audioStart": 190.7,
              "audioEnd": 192
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that hard work would bring success eventually.",
              "audioStart": 192.863,
              "audioEnd": 195.575
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "She arrived home with an empty container and a heavy heart.",
              "audioStart": 196.438,
              "audioEnd": 199.463
            },
            {
              "text": "Her mother looked at her with concern.",
              "audioStart": 200.325,
              "audioEnd": 202.125
            },
            {
              "text": "She asked what had happened on the way.",
              "audioStart": 202.988,
              "audioEnd": 204.838
            },
            {
              "text": "The girl explained everything honestly.",
              "audioStart": 205.7,
              "audioEnd": 207.787
            },
            {
              "text": "She held back her tears with great effort.",
              "audioStart": 208.65,
              "audioEnd": 210.738
            },
            {
              "text": "Her mother smiled gently.",
              "audioStart": 211.6,
              "audioEnd": 213.037
            },
            {
              "text": "She told her not to worry too much about the past.",
              "audioStart": 213.9,
              "audioEnd": 216.488
            },
            {
              "text": "Mistakes happen to everyone.",
              "audioStart": 217.35,
              "audioEnd": 218.875
            },
            {
              "text": "Knowledge is gained through such difficult trials.",
              "audioStart": 219.738,
              "audioEnd": 222.125
            },
            {
              "text": "With strong power, the young girl started to plan for another day.",
              "audioStart": 222.988,
              "audioEnd": 226.4
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that tomorrow would bring new opportunities.",
              "audioStart": 227.262,
              "audioEnd": 229.725
            },
            {
              "text": "She needed to stay focused and work hard.",
              "audioStart": 230.588,
              "audioEnd": 232.725
            },
            {
              "text": "The country road remained quiet.",
              "audioStart": 233.588,
              "audioEnd": 235.387
            },
            {
              "text": "The afternoon sun began to fall slowly behind the hills.",
              "audioStart": 236.25,
              "audioEnd": 239.35
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "She sat down by the window.",
              "audioStart": 240.213,
              "audioEnd": 241.775
            },
            {
              "text": "She watched the birds fly across the open sky.",
              "audioStart": 242.637,
              "audioEnd": 245.137
            },
            {
              "text": "Her mind was clear now.",
              "audioStart": 246,
              "audioEnd": 247.325
            },
            {
              "text": "It was free from all the previous silly thoughts.",
              "audioStart": 248.188,
              "audioEnd": 250.463
            },
            {
              "text": "She understood that real success requires care and attention.",
              "audioStart": 251.325,
              "audioEnd": 254.625
            },
            {
              "text": "Constant work is also necessary.",
              "audioStart": 255.488,
              "audioEnd": 257.438
            },
            {
              "text": "Every step she took from that moment forward was guided by reason.",
              "audioStart": 258.3,
              "audioEnd": 261.6
            },
            {
              "text": "Common sense also guided her path.",
              "audioStart": 262.462,
              "audioEnd": 264.512
            },
            {
              "text": "She would always remember the lesson learned on that bright morning.",
              "audioStart": 265.375,
              "audioEnd": 268.337
            },
            {
              "text": "Life would bring many other challenges.",
              "audioStart": 269.2,
              "audioEnd": 271.175
            },
            {
              "text": "She was ready to face them with an open mind.",
              "audioStart": 272.038,
              "audioEnd": 274.325
            },
            {
              "text": "Her family would support her through every single difficulty.",
              "audioStart": 275.188,
              "audioEnd": 279.35
            },
            {
              "text": "She looked out at the garden.",
              "audioStart": 280.212,
              "audioEnd": 281.462
            },
            {
              "text": "The green plants were growing tall in the warm sun.",
              "audioStart": 282.325,
              "audioEnd": 284.863
            },
            {
              "text": "There was still much work to do before the end of the year.",
              "audioStart": 285.725,
              "audioEnd": 288.4
            },
            {
              "text": "She took a deep breath and smiled at the future.",
              "audioStart": 289.262,
              "audioEnd": 291.725
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing could stop her from achieving her goals.",
              "audioStart": 292.587,
              "audioEnd": 294.925
            },
            {
              "text": "She remained dedicated and focused on her path.",
              "audioStart": 295.788,
              "audioEnd": 298.4
            },
            {
              "text": "The dark clouds of the past had cleared away completely.",
              "audioStart": 299.262,
              "audioEnd": 302.163
            },
            {
              "text": "They left only bright hope for tomorrow.",
              "audioStart": 303.025,
              "audioEnd": 305.038
            }
          ]
        }
